        "content": "<p>It is a nice looking proof.  I don't know if this is a good Zulip channel for this post.  If you feel like sharing more, you could post on a personal website the examples you have done,  and link to that.  With enough simple examples, people like me who like to learn by example would really appreciate such a website, and professional tutorial writers might include your example with attribution to you.  Thanks for sharing anyway.</p>",
